Added the login-flow REST services. `GET @login-providers` lists the providers a user may log in with; `GET @login-providers/<id>` starts an authorization-code flow and returns the URL to send the browser to; `POST @identity-callback` redeems the code and answers with a `jwt_auth` token. The provider redirects to a route in the Volto frontend, which is configured as `pas.plugins.identity.callback_url` rather than derived from the portal URL: with Volto the frontend and the backend need not share an origin, and providers match the registered redirect URI exactly. @ericof
